253
00:14:32,540 --> 00:14:37,260
I acted this way only because
Diavolo afforded me no other choice.

254
00:14:37,980 --> 00:14:38,810
Right now,

255
00:14:38,893 --> 00:14:42,377
the event that you are experiencing
as you stand there gawking

256
