to hang on to my soul.

259
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:54,990
Wait!

260
00:14:55,073 --> 00:14:57,317
You're saying all of this
happened because of the arrow?

261
00:14:57,400 --> 00:14:58,917
To put it in specific terms,

262
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:03,353
It was my Stan Silver Chariot that
triggered this when he took hold of it.

263
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:07,117
My original body lies lifeless upstairs,

264
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,997
but by the grace of the
arrow my soul survived

265
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:12,492
when it latched on to this turtle's form.

266
00:15:16,820 --> 00:15:18,291
There's a body over here.

267
00:15:18,400 --> 00:15:19,417
He's telling the truth.

268
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:21,912
Whatever did him in made a gigantic mess.

269
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,860
Is that really all you see?

270
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:25,100
Nothing else?

271
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:28,377
Hey, if everything you're
saying is really true,

272
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:30,517
doesn't that mean your
Silver Chariot or whatever

273
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:33,177
it's called can put us back
in our original bodies?

274
00:15:33,260 --> 00:15:34,090
No.

275
00:15:34,220 --> 00:15:35,640
In my current state,

276
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:40,080
I cannot control Chariot, nor do
I have any means to withdraw him.

277
00:15:41,020 --> 00:15:43,457
And I cannot discern his location either.

278
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:47,500
As of now, he is like an agitated
cannon that's been set loose.

279
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:50,377
So your stance just wandering
around wreaking havoc?

280
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:51,677
How could you let that happen?

281
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:52,590
Stop!

282
00:15:52,673 --> 00:15:54,177
Please just tell us what
happened to the boss.

283
00:15:54,260 --> 00:15:55,436
How did he find you?

284
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:57,976
More importantly, how do we find him?

285
00:15:58,260 --> 00:15:59,320
I don't know.

286
00:15:59,740 --> 00:16:03,740
One moment I saw him standing right
before me, and then he was gone.

287
00:16:04,900 --> 00:16:06,720
Listen, you must focus.

288
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:10,258
The arrow is not your foe,
but nor is it your friend.

289
00:16:10,820 --> 00:16:14,760
What I'm about to explain to you
is the essence of hope itself.

290
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:21,720
Let's begin with an incident seemingly
trivial to most from around two years ago.

291
00:16:23,100 --> 00:16:26,260
Having somehow survived
my encounter with Diavolo,

292
00:16:26,620 --> 00:16:30,400
I clawed my way to safety and
found refuge in a small village.

293
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:34,420
It was there and then that
the incident took place.

294
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:40,360
The arrow I'd retrieved in Egypt had gotten
itself stuck behind a chest of drawers.

295
00:16:41,260 --> 00:16:45,557
a mild displeasure but
annoying nonetheless an

296
00:16:45,640 --> 00:16:47,717
able-bodied person could
have resolved the problem

297
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:51,017
without much difficulty
but for someone like me

298
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:55,177
the task proved a little
challenging I briefly

299
00:16:55,260 --> 00:16:58,317
considered leaving it be
before the idea of using

300
00:16:58,400 --> 00:17:02,677
chariot struck me that's
when it happened with

301
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:05,477
nary a warning the arrow
sliced chariots finger

302
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:09,440
it happened so fast as
you know the arrow brings

303
00:17:10,020 --> 00:17:11,297
out stands in humans.

304
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:17,880
But should a stand happen to be
the pierced party, the full extent

305
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:20,477
of the arrow's history is unknown to me.

306
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:23,089
But I'm beginning to
understand what was in

307
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:25,497
the mind of its creator.

308
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:28,057
We've yet to witness the
full power of a stand.

309
00:17:28,140 --> 00:17:29,280
Much more lies

310
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:33,337
hidden than one could imagine.

311
00:17:33,420 --> 00:17:35,897
Suddenly, birds were falling from the sky.

312
00:17:35,980 --> 00:17:39,800
Insects hid behind the leaves as
cattle collapsed to the ground.

313
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:44,740
Lastly, the farmers fell
into a deep slumber as well.

314
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:48,280
And while I myself felt far from normal,

315
00:17:48,580 --> 00:17:52,109
the effects on me were eclipsed
by what Chariot had endured.

316
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:59,300
Taken by a foreboding feeling, I seized
the arrow from him before he lost himself.

317
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:11,120
Then, as if nothing had happened,
everything went back to normal.

318
00:18:12,060 --> 00:18:16,100
Not long after, a most ominous
realization dawned on me.

319
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:19,137
Whoever possessed enough
power to control the arrow

320
00:18:19,220 --> 00:18:22,840
could in turn steer the
minds of all living things.

321
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:26,360
That said, it cannot be me.

322
00:18:26,600 --> 00:18:28,080
I've grown much too weak.

323
00:18:28,340 --> 00:18:32,960
So I've been lying in wait for
brave warriors like yourselves,

324
00:18:33,260 --> 00:18:35,966
willing to take the fight
straight to Diavolo.

325
00:18:36,560 --> 00:18:40,060
Unfortunately for me, that
Kana has me outclassed.

326
00:18:40,220 --> 00:18:43,377
So all this mind control stuff
that you're talking about,

327
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:45,237
is it the same thing that's happening now?

328
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:48,085
Like we didn't actually
switch souls after all?

329
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:49,390
No.

330
00:18:49,473 --> 00:18:51,700
As I said earlier, it's the arrow's doing.

331
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:56,880
But as I cannot control it, the extent
of its power isn't something I can grasp.

332
00:18:57,580 --> 00:19:00,360
Even so, its potential is undeniable.

333
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:03,160
You must retrieve the arrow!

334
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:07,428
Stop Chariot before the boss
does, and take it back from him!

335
00:19:07,620 --> 00:19:09,680
To defeat Emperor Crimson,

336
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:14,115
you'll have no other choice but to
harness this weapon's full potential!

337
00:19:14,980 --> 00:19:19,274
If we're gonna recapture the arrow,
we'll have to destroy Silver Chariot.

338
00:19:19,540 --> 00:19:21,300
Am I correct to assume that?

339
00:19:21,540 --> 00:19:22,600
It doesn't matter.

340
00:19:23,040 --> 00:19:27,746
Once you've taken the arrow from him,
he'll inevitably finish his count of days.

341
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:30,857
Not unlike how, in
essence, I already have.

342
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:32,860
But before you all set off,

343
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:36,492
I have one last piece of
shocking information to give you.

344
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:39,911
Would you be the mademoiselle named Trish?

345
00:19:42,180 --> 00:19:44,717
I'm a little hairier than usual, but...

346
00:19:44,800 --> 00:19:45,940
I had a feeling...

347
00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:53,940
The boss is two men.

348
00:19:55,180 --> 00:19:58,857
Some hours ago, one of them took on
your appearance and deceived Bucciarati.

349
00:19:58,940 --> 00:19:59,770
Tarot.

350
00:19:59,940 --> 00:20:01,175
Diavolo and this lad.

351
00:20:01,460 --> 00:20:04,225
They make a formidable
duo to be reckoned with.

352
00:20:04,560 --> 00:20:05,560
What do you mean?

353
00:20:05,700 --> 00:20:06,900
He was me?

354
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:08,590
That can't be.

355
00:20:08,673 --> 00:20:10,380
The boss confides in nobody.

356
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:12,737
That's why no one knows his true face.

357
00:20:12,820 --> 00:20:18,080
I'm really not sure I get it myself, but
I know I saw him, that strange young man.

358
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:23,624
Had it not been for him, Diavolo would
have never gotten as close to me as he did.

359
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:25,362
You're kidding.

360
00:20:25,560 --> 00:20:27,037
How can he be two people?

361
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:28,037
I mean...

362
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:29,780
Giorno, something's moving.

363
00:20:31,420 --> 00:20:34,060
From nine o 'clock, Uno Signale.

364
00:20:36,940 --> 00:20:37,960
I see him.

365
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:39,080
It's a person.

366
00:20:39,340 --> 00:20:42,458
They're heading for the
Colosseum's eastern entrance.

367
00:21:01,460 --> 00:21:02,360
No way!

368
00:21:02,780 --> 00:21:03,880
I know that face!

369
00:21:04,580 --> 00:21:07,200
That's gotta be him! It's Diablo!

370
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:11,840
Narancia, it's showtime.

371
00:21:12,100 --> 00:21:13,820
Get Lil' Bomber. Jonah, wait!

372
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:15,180
To the left!

373
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:17,734
Look closely at the figure in the dark!

374
00:21:20,780 --> 00:21:22,440
He was there all along!

375
00:21:22,780 --> 00:21:25,460
The arrow has completely transformed him!

376
00:21:25,660 --> 00:21:27,900
He's now Chariot Requiem!

377
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:31,137
Son of a...

378
00:21:31,220 --> 00:21:32,540
Crap, not good.

379
00:21:33,380 --> 00:21:35,057
Diabolo's gonna beat us to him.

380
00:21:35,140 --> 00:21:37,199
At this rate, he'll take the arrow.

381
00:21:38,180 --> 00:21:39,560
Not so fast, kid.

382
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:41,153
Stay your hand for now.

383
00:21:42,100 --> 00:21:44,000
Wait, that can't be a stand.

384
00:21:44,220 --> 00:21:45,279
Is that Zipperman?

385
00:21:45,720 --> 00:21:47,820
Then that means we found him.

386
00:21:48,700 --> 00:21:49,640
Ain't no doubt.

387
00:21:50,460 --> 00:21:51,580
It's Fucerati.

388
00:22:00,420 --> 00:22:02,017
They were accusing.

389
00:22:02,100 --> 00:22:04,237
Not always with a knowing.

390
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:06,377
What is just fiction?

391
00:22:06,460 --> 00:22:08,417
Or what is the truth?

392
00:22:08,500 --> 00:22:10,537
They have a mission.

393
00:22:10,620 --> 00:22:12,497
They are the passion.

394
00:22:12,580 --> 00:22:14,897
But they dare to tell us.

395
00:22:14,980 --> 00:22:16,677
What's bad and what's good?

396
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:18,117
Stand up!

397
00:22:18,200 --> 00:22:20,217
Join us!

398
00:22:20,300 --> 00:22:22,157
Come on!

399
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:23,857
Just lead us a lie.

400
00:22:23,940 --> 00:22:26,137
We are the power.

401
00:22:26,220 --> 00:22:28,237
We'll be the future!

402
00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:31,237
Cause we are the fighters.

403
00:22:31,320 --> 00:22:34,380
Just fighting for a ride.

404
00:23:56,220 --> 00:23:59,040
Thank you.
